    "title": "Chicago firefighter injured in Austin fire, CFD officials say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "A Chicago firefighter was injured Wednesday night in a fire on the city's West Side, Chicago Fire Department officials said. The fire broke out near West Thomas Street and North Waller Avenue in Austin. The firefighter was taken to a hospital with non-life-threatening injuries, officials said. The fire has been controlled, CFD said. The cause is being investigated. No further information was immediately available.",
